	(text "System-5 VIDEO-G 1.0 GFX, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  CPU side       THE WINDOW: READ LATCH, WRITE BUFFER, WRITE REQUEST; THE Y AND CONTROL REGISTERS\n  sheet 3  Graphics RAM   THE 62256 AND ITS ADDRESS MULTIPLEXERS\n  sheet 4  Display        DISPLAY LATCH, DOT SHIFTER, THE GFX-ON GATE\n  sheet 5  Mouse          PS/2 MOUSE (ATmega328P), MOUSE LATCH (READ AT 7806), MOUSE-READY\n  sheet 6  Ribbon from TEXT J4: THE 40-PIN RIBBON FROM THE TEXT BOARD\n  sheet 7  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, SPARE GATES\n\nRedrawn 2026-11-17 (memory-mapped; power LED) from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f804f5e-15ef-5a18-a567-5e06bb3c99a1"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
